  "title": "Diameter: Dissect User-Name as IMSI on SWx interface",
  "description": "3GPP TS 29.273i section 8 indicates that the User-Name AVP is the\nIMSI on SWx, in the same way as S6a, S7a, etc.\n\nThe exception is for Command Code 305 (Push-Profile), which can\nbe either a single IMSI (in the case of a User Profile Update),\nor a user list of a wildcard or IMSI digit prefixes in the case\nof an HSS Reset Indication.",
